{
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "name": "Generate Seedance 2.5 AI videos from a form with the emaki API",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0001-4b20-9c01-000000000001",
      "name": "Video request form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "position": [
        -700,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "48f90eae-2f56-4a99-8ef1-40d963aa7068",
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "formTitle": "Seedance 2.5 video generator",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "fieldLabel": "Prompt",
              "placeholder": "A paper lantern drifting down a quiet river at dusk, slow camera follow",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldLabel": "Model",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "seedance_2_5"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "seedance_2"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "seedance_2_fast"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "seedance_2_mini"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldType": "number",
              "fieldLabel": "Duration (seconds)",
              "placeholder": "5"
            },
            {
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldLabel": "Aspect ratio",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "16:9"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "9:16"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "1:1"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "4:3"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "3:4"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "First frame image URL",
              "placeholder": "Optional: https://... image to animate"
            }
          ]
        },
        "formDescription": "Describe the clip you want. It is generated by emaki (emaki.ai) with your own API key and returned as an MP4 file."
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0002-4b20-9c01-000000000002",
      "name": "Build request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        -480,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Build the emaki request body from the form.\n// Seedance 2.5 takes 4-30 seconds, Seedance 2.0 4-15; 480p is the cheapest resolution.\nconst f = $input.first().json;\nconst parameters = {\n  duration: Number(f['Duration (seconds)']) || 5,\n  resolution: '480p',\n  aspect_ratio: f['Aspect ratio'] || '16:9',\n};\nconst image = (f['First frame image URL'] || '').trim();\nif (image) parameters.image = image;\n\nreturn [{ json: { prompt: f['Prompt'], model: f['Model'] || 'seedance_2_5', parameters } }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0003-4b20-9c01-000000000003",
      "name": "Start video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        -260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://emaki.ai/api/video/ai",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        },
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ prompt: $json.prompt, model: $json.model, parameters: $json.parameters }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "emakiApiKey01",
          "name": "emaki API key"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0004-4b20-9c01-000000000004",
      "name": "Accepted?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        -40,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "accepted-check",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0005-4b20-9c01-000000000005",
      "name": "Explain refusal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        180,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "reject-msg",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ 'emaki refused the request: ' + ($json.error || $json.message || 'unknown error') + '. 401 = check the API key, 402 = top up credits, 409 = wait for your running video, content_blocked / content_cooldown = reword the prompt.' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0006-4b20-9c01-000000000006",
      "name": "Wait 30s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ],
      "webhookId": "bf949e52-21cd-4662-856e-0f61d7b12d29",
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 30
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0007-4b20-9c01-000000000007",
      "name": "Check status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        400,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://emaki.ai/api/video/status",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        },
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ videoId: $('Start video').item.json.data.id }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "emakiApiKey01",
          "name": "emaki API key"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0008-4b20-9c01-000000000008",
      "name": "Route by status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "position": [
        620,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "outputKey": "completed",
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "version": 2,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "s-done",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "completed"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "failed",
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "version": 2,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "s-failed",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "failed"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "still generating"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0009-4b20-9c01-000000000009",
      "name": "Download video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        860,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.data.videoUrl }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "video"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0010-4b20-9c01-000000000010",
      "name": "Report failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        860,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fail-msg",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ 'The video failed on emaki (' + ($json.data.failureCode || 'no failure code') + '). Try rewording the prompt.' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0011-4b20-9c01-000000000011",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -760,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 440,
        "content": "## Seedance 2.5 video from a form\n\nTurns a prompt typed into an n8n form into a finished MP4 using **emaki** (emaki.ai), the Japanese-language AI video generator for Seedance 2.5 and Seedance 2.0.\n\nThe form also takes a model, a length, an aspect ratio and an optional first-frame image URL (image to video)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0012-4b20-9c01-000000000012",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -240,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 400,
        "height": 440,
        "content": "## Setup\n\n1. Create an API key at emaki.ai/settings/apikeys\n2. Add a **Header Auth** credential:\n   - Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer sk-...`\n3. Select it in **Start video** and **Check status**\n4. Run the workflow and open the form URL\n\nEach video costs credits on your emaki account, the same price as on the website."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e3a1c0de-0013-4b20-9c01-000000000013",
      "name": "Polling",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        200,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## How the wait works\n\nVideos can queue for several minutes. The workflow checks every 30 seconds: `completed` downloads the file, `failed` reports the failure code, anything else loops back to the wait. An account generates one video at a time, so a second submit while one is running returns 409."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
